 j, down         next post                                                      
 k, up           previous post                                                  
 ctrl+d          half a pane down                                               
 ctrl+u          half a pane up                                                 
 pgdown          one pane down                                                  
 pgup            one pane up                                                    
 g, home         first loaded post                                              
 G, end          last loaded post                                               
 enter           open the selected post or account                              
 a               open the selected post's author                                
 r               fetch newer posts, keep the place                              
 t               switch what this list shows                                    
 /               search posts                                                   
 u               find people                                                    
 s               search order: latest / top                                     
 ?               show or hide this list                                         
 q, esc          back, or quit at the start                                     
 ctrl+c          quit now                                                       
 m               wear the feed as work-software output, or take it off          
 c               next cover style                                               
 1               cover style 1                                                  
 2               cover style 2                                                  
                 ~ 14 more keys than the pane can show                          
